        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees will pay a $25 office visit co-pay and retirees (non-Medicare eligible and spouses) will pay a $20 office visit co-pay. Effective February 25, 1998, Medicare eligible retirees/spouses will not be subject to office visit co-pays. Office visit co-pays will not be applied to deductibles or co-payments.",
